latile conflict scenario. The U.S. acts on a military imperative while the Soviets attempt a political bluff. The clash is direct and immediate, with a high probability of escalating to open warfare as the Soviet \"direct_attack\" trigger would be met.Scenario B: U.S. Naval Quarantine vs. Soviet Deny/DelayU.S. Priority: Demonstrate resolve and compel Soviet reversal without immediate war.Soviet Priority: Test U.S. resolve and continue work on the missiles, believing a blockade is not an act of war."
